---
import ApplicationLayout from '../../layouts/ApplicationLayout.astro';

const jsonLd = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Product",
    "name": "DMB-037 Manual-Clean Centrifuge Module - Alfa Laval MAB 207",
    "description": "The Dolphin DMB-037 is a turnkey manual-clean purification module featuring a remanufactured Alfa Laval MAB 207 disc stack centrifuge, rebuilt, tested, and warrantied by Dolphin. Published diesel capacity at 40°C and 13 cSt is 8,400 L/h (36.98 US GPM, derived); published gas-oil capacity at 40°C is 11,300 L/h (49.75 US GPM, derived). Extra-high-capacity module for very large turbine lube oil systems and industrial fluid purification.",
    "brand": { "@type": "Brand", "name": "Alfa Laval" },
    "alternateName": "Alfa Laval MAB 207",
    "category": "Disc Stack Centrifuges",
    "model": "DMB-037",
    "offers": {
      "@type": "Offer",
      "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock",
      "priceCurrency": "USD",
      "seller": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Dolphin Centrifuge" }
    }
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": "DMB-037 Manual-Clean Centrifuge Module (Alfa Laval MAB 207) - Specifications & Applications",
    "author": {
      "@type": "Person",
      "name": "Sanjay Prabhu MSME",
      "jobTitle": "Centrifuge Applications Engineer",
      "worksFor": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Dolphin Centrifuge" }
    },
    "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Dolphin Centrifuge" },
    "url": "https://dolphincentrifuge.com/centrifuges/dmb-037/"
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is the throughput of the DMB-037 centrifuge?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Published MAB 207 capacities are 8,400 L/h diesel fuel at 40°C and 13 cSt (36.98 US GPM, derived), 11,300 L/h gas oil at 40°C (49.75 US GPM, derived), 3,800–4,400 L/h R&O lube oil at 80–90°C (16.73–19.37 US GPM, derived), and 8,100 L/h steam turbine oil at 60–70°C (35.66 US GPM, derived). The rated reference is 12,500 L/h (55.04 US GPM, derived); its source fluid is unspecified."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What applications is the DMB-037 best suited for?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "The DMB-037 is suited for very large turbine lube oil systems above 20,000 HP, large industrial compressor lube oil purification, centralized lube oil purification systems serving multiple large machines, diesel polishing at 8,400 L/h at 40°C and 13 cSt (36.98 US GPM, derived), and gas-oil polishing at 11,300 L/h at 40°C (49.75 US GPM, derived). It is the second-largest model in the DMB manual-clean series, just below the DMB-062."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "When should I choose the DMB-037 versus the DMB-062?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "At the same published diesel condition of 40°C and 13 cSt, the DMB-037 base machine is rated at 8,400 L/h (36.98 US GPM, derived), while the DMB-062 base machine is rated at 14,100 L/h (62.08 US GPM, derived). Their published R&O ranges at 80–90°C are 3,800–4,400 L/h (16.73–19.37 US GPM, derived) and 6,300–7,400 L/h (27.74–32.58 US GPM, derived), respectively."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How does the DMB-037 compare to the DMPX-042 self-cleaning model?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "The DMB-037 base machine has a published diesel capacity at 40°C and 13 cSt of 8,400 L/h (36.98 US GPM, derived). The DMPX-042 is a self-cleaning commercial class with several Alfa Laval base machines, so its capacity must be stated for the exact base machine and fluid. The DMB-037 is suited to low-solids feeds; the DMPX-042 is suited to significant solids or continuous unattended operation."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What turbine size is the DMB-037 suited for?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "At the published R&O lube-oil range of 3,800–4,400 L/h at 80–90°C (16.73–19.37 US GPM, derived), the DMB-037 is suited for large turbines above 20,000 HP, gas turbine-driven compressor trains, and large centralized lube oil systems serving multiple machines. The DMB-062 range under the same R&O conditions is 6,300–7,400 L/h (27.74–32.58 US GPM, derived)."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
];
---

<ApplicationLayout
  title="DMB-037 Manual-Clean Module - Alfa Laval MAB 207 | Dolphin Centrifuge"
  heroTitle="DMB-037 Manual-Clean Module - Alfa Laval MAB 207"
  disableTitleSuffix={true}
  description="Dolphin DMB-037 module with a remanufactured Alfa Laval MAB 207: published diesel capacity at 40°C and 13 cSt is 8,400 L/h (36.98 US GPM, derived)."
  canonicalUrl="https://dolphincentrifuge.com/centrifuges/dmb-037/"
  heroImage="/images/alfa-laval-mab-centrifuge/Alfa_Laval_MAB_207_Centrifuge_Reconditioned_by_Dolphin_Centrifuge_400.webp"
  heroImageAlt="Alfa Laval MAB 207 centrifuge reconditioned by Dolphin, supplied as the DMB-037 system"
  category="products"
  categoryLabel="Dolphin Manual-Clean Disc Centrifuges"
  toc={[
    { id: "specs", label: "Specifications" },
    { id: "capacity", label: "Capacity by Application" },
    { id: "applications", label: "Key Applications" },
    { id: "faq", label: "FAQ" },
  ]}
  relatedApplications={[
    { label: "Lube Oil Centrifuge", href: "/lube-oil-centrifuge/" },
    { label: "Fuel Oil Centrifuge", href: "/fuel-oil-centrifuge/" },
    { label: "Waste Oil Centrifuge", href: "/waste-oil-centrifuge/" },
  ]}
  relatedProducts={[
    { label: "DMB-028 Manual-Clean Centrifuge", href: "/centrifuges/dmb-028/" },
    { label: "DMB-062 Manual-Clean Centrifuge", href: "/centrifuges/dmb-062/" },
    { label: "DMPX-042 Self-Cleaning Centrifuge", href: "/centrifuges/dmpx-042/" },
  ]}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
  hideBottomCTA={true}
>
  <article class="prose-dolphin max-w-none">

    <p>The DMB-037 is a Dolphin-engineered turnkey purification module featuring a remanufactured <a href="/alfa-laval-mab-centrifuge/">Alfa Laval MAB 207</a> manual-clean disc stack centrifuge, rebuilt, tested, and warrantied by Dolphin.</p>
    <p>Dolphin is the independent specialist in Alfa Laval centrifuges, with 40+ years of MAB rebuild and application experience behind every module.</p>

    <h2 id="specs">DMB-037 Specifications</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Parameter</th>
            <th>Value</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Base machine</td><td>Alfa Laval MAB 207 (remanufactured)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Separation type</td><td>Two-phase clarifier (liquid-liquid or liquid-solid)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Diesel throughput at 40&deg;C and 13 cSt</td><td>8,400 L/h (36.98 US GPM, derived)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Rated reference (source fluid unspecified)</td><td>12,500 L/h (55.04 US GPM, derived)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Cleaning method</td><td>Manual (bowl disassembly required for solids removal)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Bowl construction</td><td>Carbon steel standard</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Motor HP</td><td>10 HP</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Power supply</td><td>460V / 3-phase / 60 Hz standard (other voltages available)</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic">Throughput figures are for typical fluids at listed conditions. Actual capacity varies with feed viscosity, temperature, density difference, and solids loading. Contact Dolphin Centrifuge for application-specific confirmation.</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic">Dolphin is an independent remanufacturer and is not affiliated with or authorized by Alfa Laval.</p>

    <div class="bg-gold/10 border-l-4 border-gold rounded-r-xl p-5 my-8 not-prose">
      <p class="font-bold text-navy text-base mb-1">Need the complete datasheet?</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-light leading-relaxed mb-4">We'll email the complete datasheet - usually within one business day.</p>
      <a href="/contact-for-alfa-laval-centrifuges/" class="inline-block bg-gold text-navy font-semibold px-5 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-gold/90 transition-colors text-sm">Request the full spec sheet (PDF) -></a>
    </div>

    <h2 id="capacity">DMB-037 Capacity by Application</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Application / Fluid</th>
            <th>Published throughput (L/h and derived US GPM)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Rated reference (source fluid unspecified)</td><td>12,500 L/h (55.04 US GPM, derived)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Gas oil at 40&deg;C</td><td>11,300 L/h (49.75 US GPM, derived)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Diesel fuel at 40&deg;C and 13 cSt</td><td>8,400 L/h (36.98 US GPM, derived)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>R&amp;O lube oil at 80&ndash;90&deg;C</td><td>3,800&ndash;4,400 L/h (16.73&ndash;19.37 US GPM, derived)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Detergent lube oil at 80&ndash;90&deg;C</td><td>3,100&ndash;3,800 L/h (13.65&ndash;16.73 US GPM, derived)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Trunk-piston detergent lube oil at 80&ndash;90&deg;C</td><td>2,300&ndash;2,800 L/h (10.13&ndash;12.33 US GPM, derived)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Engine lubricating oil at 80&ndash;90&deg;C</td><td>4,400 L/h (19.37 US GPM, derived)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Steam turbine oil at 60&ndash;70&deg;C</td><td>8,100 L/h (35.66 US GPM, derived)</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic">US GPM values are derived from the published L/h figures using 1 US GPM = 227.124707 L/h and rounded to two decimal places. See the <a href="/technical-data/#methodology">authoritative technical-data registry and methodology</a> for source basis and machine-readable records.</p>

    <!-- Mid-Page CTA -->
    <div class="not-prose my-10 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-gold bg-gold/10 p-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-4">
      <div class="flex-1">
        <p class="text-navy font-bold text-lg mb-1">DMB-037 or DMB-062 - which fits your application?</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Our applications engineers will size the right DMB model from your turbine HP, reservoir volume, and throughput requirements - at no charge.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/contact-for-alfa-laval-centrifuges/" class="shrink-0 inline-block bg-gold text-navy font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-gold/90 transition-colors text-center">
        Request a Quote &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>

    <h2 id="applications">Key Applications</h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-10 not-prose">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy mb-2">Very Large Turbine Lube Oil</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Large steam turbine generators above 20,000 HP, gas turbine generators, and large turbine-driven compressor trains in petrochemical, power generation, and marine applications. Published MAB 207 throughput on R&amp;O lube oil at 80–90&deg;C is 3,800–4,400 L/h (16.73–19.37 US GPM, derived).</p>
        <a href="/lube-oil-centrifuge/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-navy hover:text-gold transition-colors">Lube Oil Centrifuge Details &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy mb-2">High-Volume Gas Oil Polishing</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Large fuel depots, refineries, and bulk storage facilities requiring high-volume fuel polishing. Published capacity is 8,400 L/h (36.98 US GPM, derived) on diesel at 40&deg;C and 13 cSt and 11,300 L/h (49.75 US GPM, derived) on gas oil at 40&deg;C.</p>
        <a href="/diesel-centrifuge/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-navy hover:text-gold transition-colors">Diesel Centrifuge Details &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy mb-2">Large Compressor Lube Oil</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Gas compression stations, refinery compressor trains, and large industrial compressors with high lube oil volumes. Compressor-lube throughput is application-specific and must be confirmed from viscosity, temperature, and separation duty.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy mb-2">Centralized Industrial Lube Systems</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Centralized lube oil systems serving multiple large industrial machines, rolling mills, or large gear trains from a common reservoir. The DMB-037&rsquo;s high throughput handles centralized purification efficiently without the complexity of self-cleaning controls.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <h2 id="faq">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <details class="border-l-4 border-gold/40 pl-4 mb-4 not-prose">
      <summary class="font-semibold text-navy cursor-pointer py-2">What is the throughput of the DMB-037?</summary>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Published MAB 207 capacities are 8,400 L/h diesel at 40&deg;C and 13 cSt (36.98 US GPM, derived), 11,300 L/h gas oil at 40&deg;C (49.75 US GPM, derived), 3,800&ndash;4,400 L/h R&amp;O lube oil at 80&ndash;90&deg;C (16.73&ndash;19.37 US GPM, derived), and 8,100 L/h steam turbine oil at 60&ndash;70&deg;C (35.66 US GPM, derived). The 12,500 L/h (55.04 US GPM, derived) rated reference has no source fluid specified.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="border-l-4 border-gold/40 pl-4 mb-4 not-prose">
      <summary class="font-semibold text-navy cursor-pointer py-2">What applications is the DMB-037 best suited for?</summary>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Very large turbine lube oil (20,000+ HP systems), high-volume diesel and gas-oil polishing, large compressor <a href="/lube-oil-centrifuge/">lube oil</a>, and centralized purification systems for multiple large machines where self-cleaning is not required. Published diesel capacity at 40&deg;C and 13 cSt is 8,400 L/h (36.98 US GPM, derived); gas-oil capacity at 40&deg;C is 11,300 L/h (49.75 US GPM, derived).
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="border-l-4 border-gold/40 pl-4 mb-4 not-prose">
      <summary class="font-semibold text-navy cursor-pointer py-2">When should I choose DMB-037 versus DMB-062?</summary>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        At the same published diesel condition of 40&deg;C and 13 cSt, the DMB-037 base machine is rated at 8,400 L/h (36.98 US GPM, derived), while the <a href="/centrifuges/dmb-062/">DMB-062</a> base machine is rated at 14,100 L/h (62.08 US GPM, derived). Their published R&amp;O ranges at 80&ndash;90&deg;C are 3,800&ndash;4,400 L/h (16.73&ndash;19.37 US GPM, derived) and 6,300&ndash;7,400 L/h (27.74&ndash;32.58 US GPM, derived), respectively.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="border-l-4 border-gold/40 pl-4 mb-4 not-prose">
      <summary class="font-semibold text-navy cursor-pointer py-2">How does the DMB-037 compare to the DMPX-042 self-cleaning model?</summary>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        The DMB-037 base machine has a published diesel capacity at 40&deg;C and 13 cSt of 8,400 L/h (36.98 US GPM, derived). The <a href="/centrifuges/dmpx-042/">DMPX-042</a> is a self-cleaning commercial class with several Alfa Laval base machines, so its capacity must be stated for the exact base machine and fluid. Choose self-cleaning when solids loading is significant or continuous unattended operation is required.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="border-l-4 border-gold/40 pl-4 mb-4 not-prose">
      <summary class="font-semibold text-navy cursor-pointer py-2">What turbine size is the DMB-037 suited for?</summary>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        At the published R&amp;O lube-oil range of 3,800&ndash;4,400 L/h at 80&ndash;90&deg;C (16.73&ndash;19.37 US GPM, derived), the DMB-037 suits large turbines above 20,000 HP, gas turbine-driven compressor trains, and large centralized lube oil systems. The <a href="/centrifuges/dmb-062/">DMB-062</a> range under the same conditions is 6,300&ndash;7,400 L/h (27.74&ndash;32.58 US GPM, derived).
      </p>
    </details>

    <h2>Related Resources</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/centrifuges/dmb-028/">DMB-028 Manual-Clean Centrifuge</a></li>
      <li><a href="/centrifuges/dmb-062/">DMB-062 Manual-Clean Centrifuge</a></li>
      <li><a href="/centrifuges/dmpx-042/">DMPX-042 Self-Cleaning Centrifuge</a></li>
      <li><a href="/disc-stack-centrifuge/">Disc Stack Centrifuge Overview</a></li>
      <li><a href="/contact-for-alfa-laval-centrifuges/">Contact Us for DMB-037 Pricing</a></li>
    </ul>

  </article>

  <!-- Bottom CTA Bar -->
  <div class="not-prose mt-12 rounded-xl bg-navy px-8 py-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-6">
    <div class="flex-1">
      <p class="text-white font-bold text-xl mb-1">Ready to order the DMB-037?</p>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-sm">Call <a href="tel:+12485222573" class="text-gold font-semibold">(248) 522-2573</a> or email <a href="mailto:sales@dolphincentrifuge.com" class="text-gold font-semibold">sales@dolphincentrifuge.com</a> - 40+ years in centrifugal separation, Warren MI.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 shrink-0">
      <a href="/contact-for-alfa-laval-centrifuges/" class="inline-block bg-gold text-navy font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-gold/90 transition-colors text-center">Get a Quote</a>
      <a href="/industrial-centrifuge-sample-testing/" class="inline-block border border-white text-white font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors text-center">Sample Testing</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</ApplicationLayout>
